OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid to man killed by
OL,4,Afalling tree in Storm Boelo
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes have been paid to a man who
OL,7,Fdied after being hit by a falling tree
OL,8,Fin Dumfries and Galloway.
OL,10,FRichard Baines, 60, the long-serving
OL,11,Fcurator of Logan Botanic Garden near
OL,12,FStranraer, died during Storm Boelo on
OL,13,FSunday morning.
OL,15,FIt is understood that he was walking
OL,16,Fnear his home in Mid Kelton, just
OL,17,Foutside Castle Douglas, when the
OL,18,Faccident happened.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
