OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid to man killed by
OL,4,Afalling tree in Storm Boelo
OL,5,
OL,6,FDavid Knott, director of horticulture
OL,7,Fat the Royal Botanic Garden in
OL,8,FEdinburgh, said they were "desperately
OL,9,Fsad, devastated" by the news.
